@host = http://localhost:5208
@token = paste-a-WSO2-access-token-here

### Search the audit log by order reference (timeline, oldest first)
GET {{host}}/api/audit?orderReference=ORD-260924-K7P2QM
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Newest entries of one event type in a date range
GET {{host}}/api/audit?eventType=PaymentRecorded&from=2026-09-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-09-30T23:59:59Z&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### One entry with its hashes and payload
GET {{host}}/api/audit/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Verify the company's hash chain (Company Admin)
GET {{host}}/api/audit/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
